# The Infamous Cruelclaw: "You may cast that card" (CR 608.2g): a spell that needs a target is cast only if it has a legal one (CR 601.2c, 115.1).
# The trigger exiles Forest and Counterspell, whose only target is a spell, and the stack holds none: Bot1 is not asked, nothing is
# discarded, and the Counterspell stays in exile with the Forest. Bot1 keeps its whole hand.

